## Backend — Update Area

Review DESIGN.md and use the exact documented update endpoint and contract.

Do not invent a new endpoint if the design already defines one.

The update flow should conceptually be:

Request
    ↓
Find Area inside Workspace
    ↓
Validate expected version
    ↓
Validate new geometry/name
    ↓
Calculate authoritative areaKm2
    ↓
Update current Area
    ↓
Increment currentVersion
    ↓
Insert new AreaVersion
    ↓
Commit
    ↓
Return updated Area

Area update and AreaVersion insertion must be atomic.

Use one transaction for the mutation.

