## AreaVersion

On every successful update:

Area.currentVersion = previousVersion + 1

and create:

AreaVersion
    areaId = Area.id
    version = Area.currentVersion
    changeType = UPDATED
    name = updated Area name
    geometry = updated geometry
    areaKm2 = updated authoritative area
    changedBy = current prototype user
    changedAt = current timestamp

Use the exact existing schema/model names from the repository.

Do not change the AreaVersion model unless required by DESIGN.md or the
existing schema is insufficient.

Do not implement history REST API yet unless it is strictly required for
the update workflow.

