## Workspace Boundary

An Area must only be updated through its owning Workspace.

A request such as:

PUT /workspaces/A/areas/{areaId}

must not update an Area belonging to Workspace B.

Review DESIGN.md for the expected response semantics.

Do not implement authentication/authorization yet.

Workspace ownership boundary and user authorization are separate concerns.

